TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Sen de{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}} bu minik gözde mekânı{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}} görmeye mi geldin?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:001D:}}
Burası duyduğuma göre dünyanın
en havalı kasabasıymış!
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Biz turistler{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}} birbirimizi kollamalıyız.{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0003:0016:}}
Hey,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} hadi arkadaş olalım! {{TAG:0007:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0027:}}İstediğin zaman
buraya gelip takılabilirsin {{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Anche tu qui in visita, eh? {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}{{TAG:0003:0015:}}
Proprio come me! {{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}Mi hanno detto
che {{TAG:0005:0005:}} è troppo da urlo!
{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Cioè, è una città supermegatrendy!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0003:0009:}}
Spero solo che i paparazzi
non riescano a scovarmi anche qui...

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Sadece ziyarete geldin, {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}öyle mi? {{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}Ben de.
{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Bu kasabayı seviyorum, {{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}ama yol biraz uzun.{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0003:001D:}}
Keşke biraz daha yakında yaşasaydım!

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0020:}}Coucou !{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Je l'adooore, ta ville !!!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:0026:}}Le camping
est super !
{{TAG:0003:001D:}}Vive les vacances à {{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}{{TAG:0005:0005:}} !{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
La vie au grand air,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} c'est super ! {{TAG:0003:0004:}}
Je veux vivre dans une tente !

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0020:}}Ciaaao!{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Sono venuta in campeggio
nella tua città! È supercarinissima!
{{TAG:0003:001D:}}E che relax qui {{TAG:000E:0010:}} {{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}{{TAG:0005:0005:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Con tutto 'sto verde!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0004:}}
Mi piace davvero un sacchissimo!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0020:}}Heya!{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Look, {{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}I know it's kinda sudden,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}{{TAG:0003:0027:}} but
I've decided to set up camp here.
{{TAG:0003:001B:}}This trip was {{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}SO last minute, {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}but{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}{{TAG:0003:0015:}}
I'm totally glad{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}} I listened to that
little voice inside my head!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0020:}}Ehilà!{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Come va? Ho deciso di piantare
la mia tenda in questa città!
{{TAG:0003:001B:}}La mia è una gitarella decisa così,{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}
su due zampe!{{TAG:0003:0015:}} A volte bisogna
seguire il proprio istinto, non credi?

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0020:}}Selammm!{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Bak, {{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}biraz ani oldu biliyorum,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}{{TAG:0003:0027:}} ama buraya
kamp kurmaya karar verdim.
{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Bu gezi tamamen{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}} SON DAKİKA oldu, {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}ama{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}{{TAG:0003:0015:}}
içimdeki sese kulak verdiğime{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}} çok sevindim!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:002B:}}¿Dónde podría construir mi casa?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
¡Cerca de las tiendas sería ideal,
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:002B:}}Cioè, mi domando e dico: chissà
dove posso costruire la mia casa?!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Quale sarà il quartiere più trendy?

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}It's {{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}REALLY important that I get
along with my neighbors.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} I mean,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}{{TAG:0003:0027:}}
we're all in it together,{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}} right?
{{TAG:0003:0026:}}That means I'll have to do a little
snooping around {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}{{TAG:0003:001D:}}and check out{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}
what kinds of folks live here!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Komşularımla iyi anlaşmam{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}} GERÇEKTEN önemli.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Yani,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}{{TAG:0003:0027:}} hepimiz aynı yerde yaşayacağız,{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}} değil mi?
{{TAG:0003:0026:}}Demek ki biraz etrafı kolaçan edip{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}{{TAG:0003:001D:}} burada{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}
ne tür insanlar yaşıyor bakmalıyım!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0011:0000:0000}} practically begged me{{TAG:0003:0004:}}
to move here, {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}and I just didn't have
the heart{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}} to say no!
Plus,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}{{TAG:0003:001D:}} it's a pretty awesome town.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} I
can't wait to meet more folks from{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0005:}} while I'm here camping!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:002C:}}Kasabada kimse{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}} benim gibi bir süperstarın buraya{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}
kampa gelmesini beklemiyordu bence!
{{TAG:0003:0027:}}Umarım{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}} ortalığı fazla karıştırmıyorumdur.{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0003:001F:}}
Normal hayatınıza devam edin{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}} millet!
{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}Bakacak bir şey yok!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:002B:}}Sometimes I wonder{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}} what it'd be
like to actually {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}LIVE in this town{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}
instead of just visiting.{{TAG:000F:0005:15002800}}
It's great! Move here!
It's OK, I guess.

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:002B:}}Bazen sadece ziyaret etmek yerine{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}} bu kasabada{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
gerçekten YAŞASAM{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}} nasıl olur diye düşünüyorum.{{TAG:000F:0005:15002800}}
